{"id": "q0409", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Philly Special was a play in the Super Bowl that involved a trick play where the quarterback throw s the ball to the running back who then throws it to another player for a touchdown.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0421", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The best way to swing a golf iron compared to a golf driver is to use a slightly more controlled and precise motion for the iron, while the driver requires a faster, powerful swing with more emphasis on generating speed. For an ir on, you want to maintain balance and keep your arms relatively straight, focusing on making solid contact with the ball and controlling distance. With the driver, you' re aiming for maximum swing speed and height, so you can hit the ball far er, often with a more fluid and aggressive motion. Overall, both require proper technique, but the key difference lies in the intent: precision for ir ons and power for drivers.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 37, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0426", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The shot clock is a timer used in basketball games to limit the amount of time a team has to attempt a shot. It starts when the ball goes out of bounds and stops if the ball is touched or thrown into the basket, or if the team commits a foul or turns it over.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 15, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0437", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The GE-8 3 2BH is a type of gas turbine engine. It's used in aircraft, especially for military fighter jet s. This engine helps the plane fly fast and maneuver well. The \"GE\" stands for General Electric, the company that makes it.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0452", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Less Misérable was written by Victor Hugo. It's a classic French novel published in the 19th century and it's famous for its deep themes about justice, red emption, and social inequality. It has been adapted into many stage plays and musical s, especially the famous musical version.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 17, "carrier_ended": null}
